# Layout

Single crate `gprx`. Not a Cargo workspace. Do not create empty files ahead of the Issue that needs them.

```
src/lib.rs          # small public re-exports
src/error.rs        # P1A-1
src/workspace.rs    # P1A-2。`Workspace`（fit）と `QueryWorkspace`（predict_into）。同じ struct に詰め込まない
src/likelihood.rs   # P1A-3
src/kernel/         # all kernel leaves; never at src/*.rs。`compiled/` は `mod.rs`（enum・葉ナビ）+ `apply.rs` + `grad.rs` + `hess.rs` + `tests.rs`
src/transform/      # target.rs, input.rs, pipeline.rs, columnwise.rs。葉に分けない（P2B-20）。空ファイルは先に置かない
src/gpr/            # `mod.rs` 再エクスポート。`Gpr` と `FittedGpr` は `model.rs`。`FittedGpr` の impl は `fitted.rs`。`OnlineGpr` は `online.rs`。公開の小さい型は `types.rs`、Gram / Cholesky / MLL は `factor.rs`、単体テストは `tests.rs`
src/objective.rs    # Phase 1b
src/optimizer/      # P2B-1 / P2B-2 / P2B-15 / P2B-17。`mod.rs` トレイト、`logit.rs`、ソルバは `lbfgs.rs` / `ncg.rs` / `neldermead.rs` / `fsa.rs` / `newton.rs`
src/rng.rs          # P2B-15。クレート私有の `SmallRng`（`sample` / リスタート / FSA）
src/persist/        # P2B-14。`config.json` + `model.safetensors`。`LoadedGpr` / `PersistRegistry`。P3-3: 必須 `factor_kind`（`llt` / `ldlt`）
src/online.rs       # P3-2。crate-private `OnlineWorkspace` と `ensure_capacity`
src/sparse.rs       # P4-2 / P4-3 / P4-4 / P4-6 / P4-8。公開 `SparseGpr` / `FittedSparseGpr` / `FixedInducing` / `FreeInducing` / `OnlineSparseGpr`。`SparseGpr<O: Optimizer = Lbfgs, I = FixedInducing>` の `fit` / `with_optimizer` / `with_inducing`。`SparseGpr<Fixed, I>::factor`。`FittedSparseGpr::into_online`。対角 `predict` / `predict_with` / NLML / `value_and_gradient_into` / `hessian_into`。自由 Z の params はカーネル θ・尤度 θ・列優先 Z。`OnlineSparseGpr` は X の `insert` / `delete` / `point_ids`（Z 固定。params はカーネル θ・尤度 θ）。`SparseGprObjective` は `src/objective.rs`
tests/              # analytic.rs, goldens.rs, alloc.rs, recovery.rs, fit_goldens.rs, nelder_mead_goldens.rs; M0: cholesky_smoke.rs。P3-1: ldlt_delete.rs。P3-5: online_ops.rs。P3-6: online_libgp.rs。P4-8: sparse_ops.rs
benches/            # criterion; from P1A-18 (after first `Gpr` path)
compare/            # uv + sklearn + goldens/*.json。P2B-16 は compare/perf/（gprx / sklearn / libgp / friedrich。手動、CI なし）。P3-6 は `just gen-online-goldens` と `just perf-online`
examples/           # Phase 1b; P2-9 updates to `Gpr` + `FittedGpr`
.dev/               # design, roadmap, bench-log.md
```

M0 creates root crate files and `src/lib.rs` only. `src/kernel/` starts at P1A-5.

Public at Phase 1b / 2: `Gpr`, `Prediction`, `VarianceKind`, `PredictOptions`, `DistanceCachePolicy`, `kernel`, `GaussianLikelihood`, `transform`, `GprError`. P2-8 adds `FittedGpr`; `Gpr` becomes trainer-only (`fit(self)`). P2B: `Gpr<O: Optimizer = Lbfgs>` and `Gpr<Fixed>` (no `optimize: bool`, no ignored `solver`). Public `Optimizer` / `Objective` / `Differentiable` / `TwiceDifferentiable` / `IncrementalObjective`, `Interval` / `BoundedParam`, `FullRecompute` / `IncrementalRecompute` / `UsesChangeIndices` / `AcceptsRecompute` / `PoleRecompute`, `KernelTerm` / `KernelSpec::Custom`, `JitterPolicy`, `PredictiveCovariance`, `UnfittedTarget` / `UnfittedTransform` / `FittedStandardizeTarget` / `FittedMinMaxTarget` / `FittedStandardizeInput` / `FittedMinMaxInput`, `Pipeline` / `TargetPipeline` / `FittedPipeline` / `FittedTargetPipeline`, `ColumnwiseInput` / `FittedColumnwiseInput`, `NoDistanceCache` (`Gpr::from_points` for Linear / Constant / White). P2B-14: `FittedGpr::save` / `save_with_factor`, `LoadedGpr` / `LoadedDistance` / `PersistRegistry` / `FORMAT_VERSION`. P2B-15: `FastSimulatedAnnealing` / `BoundaryPolicy`. P2B-17: `Newton` / `FittedGpr::hessian_into`. P2B-18: `GprObjective<IncrementalRecompute>` implements `IncrementalObjective`; leaf Grams live on the objective. P2B-19 / P2B-21 / P2B-23: `CachedDistances` (default) / `UncachedDistances` / `RetainCholesky` / `ReuseCholesky` / `CholeskyBuffer` / `DistanceCachePolicy` stay crate-root. Public switch is `Gpr::with_prefer_memory` / `with_prefer_speed` (memory = `UncachedDistances` + `ReuseCholesky` + `FullRecompute`, speed = default `CachedDistances` + `RetainCholesky`, and `IncrementalRecompute` when `O: UsesChangeIndices`). There is no `with_recompute_strategy`. `with_optimizer` follows the same `B` rule. `with_distance_cache_policy` / `with_cholesky_buffer` are `pub(crate)`. `from_points` has the same prefer methods (`C` stays `NoDistanceCache`). `FittedGpr` has no `with_prefer_*`. P3-3: crate-root `OnlineGpr` (`src/gpr/online.rs`). `FittedGpr::into_online(self)` converts LLT→LDLT. `insert` is on `OnlineGpr` only. persist `factor_kind` is required (`llt` → `FittedGpr`, `ldlt` → `OnlineGpr`). `LoadedOnlineDistance` is crate-root. P3-4: crate-root `PointId`. `delete(id: PointId)` and `point_ids()` are on `OnlineGpr`. `PointRegistry` is crate-private on `OnlineGpr`. persist `ldlt` requires `point_ids` and `next_point_id`. P4-2 / P4-3 / P4-4 / P4-6 / P4-8: crate-root `SparseGpr` / `FittedSparseGpr` / `FixedInducing` / `FreeInducing` / `OnlineSparseGpr` (`src/sparse.rs`)。`SparseGpr<O: Optimizer = Lbfgs, I = FixedInducing>` の `fit` / `with_optimizer` / `with_inducing`。`SparseGpr<Fixed, I>::factor`。`FittedSparseGpr::into_online(self) -> OnlineSparseGpr<O>`（`I` は無い。`Z` は座標。params はカーネル θ・尤度 θ）。`FittedSparseGpr` は対角 `predict` / `predict_with`、`neg_log_marginal_likelihood`（VFE の負の ELBO）、`get_params` / `set_params` / `num_params`（既定はカーネル θ のあと尤度 θ。`FreeInducing` は続けて列優先 Z）、`value_and_gradient_into`、`hessian_into`（row-major `p×p`）。`OnlineSparseGpr` は `insert` / `delete(PointId)` / `point_ids` / 対角 `predict` / NLML / `refit` / `into_fitted`。Caller supplies `Z`. No `predict_into` / covariance / sample / LOO. Keep `Workspace`, `QueryWorkspace`, `OnlineWorkspace`, and faer types crate-private. Combinations that would be ignored or rejected at runtime must not be representable (`.cursor/rules/types.mdc`).

Unit tests: `#[cfg(test)]` in the module. Integration tests: `tests/`. Golden files only under `compare/goldens/`.
